title: Investigating Domestic Enemies
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
view-if: marcher_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "Marcher"
#card-image: img/portraits/HeathCarl.jpg
#is-card: true
#new-page: true

# this is not a card...

= Investigating Domestic Enemies

As we have control over the Interior Ministry, we can direct police and intelligence services to investigate internal enemies. We can proscribe various organizations.

- @deport_hitler
- @ban_sa: Ban the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>.
- @unban_sa: Unban the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>.
- @persecute_sa
- @ban_sh: Ban the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>.
- @unban_sh: Unban the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>.
- @persecute_sh
- @ban_rfb: Ban the <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivist</span> <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span>.
- @unban_rfb: Unban the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span>.
- @persecute_rfb
- @root: Take no action for now.

@ban_sa
view-if: loyalist_banned == 0
choose-if: royalist_urgency >= 3
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> have not yet given the public cause enough — a ban now would read as naked partisanship, and would never survive the courts.
on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.85; loyalist_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; loyalist_banned_pro = 1 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; loyalist_banned_pro = 0 if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7; loyalist_banned = 1; gold_relation -= 3; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.05; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; loyalist_militancy -= 0.05; loyalist_ban_timer = 6; loyalist_coup_progress = coup_progress; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 6; interior_goal_heartland -= 1

As it turns out, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> has many allies in the police and bureaucracy. Our relationship with the police weakens, and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> can still organize illegally, right under the police's noses. [? if loyalist_banned_pro : Nevertheless, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> is substantially weakened by our ban. ?]

[? if coup_progress >= 6: There are reports of an imminent coup by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. We have disrupted some of these plans, but the threat is still present. ?]

@unban_sa
view-if: loyalist_banned = 1 and in_popular_front_heartland == 0 and in_left_front_heartland == 0
on-arrival: loyalist_banned = 0; loyalist_strength += 100; loyalist_militancy += 0.05; coup_progress += 2 if loyalist_coup_progress >= 6

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> is no longer banned. They immediately go on a recruiting spree.

@persecute_sa
title: Further persecute the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>.
view-if: loyalist_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 3 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: loyalist_strength *= 0.7; loyalist_militancy -= 0.05; coup_progress -= 2 if coup_progress >= 4

We have arrested more of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span>'s leaders and confiscated their weapons.

[? if coup_progress >= 4: There are reports of a planned coup by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. We have cracked down on some of these plans, but the threat still lingers. ?]

@ban_sh
on-arrival: warden_strength *= 0.85; warden_strength *= 0.7 if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7; warden_banned = 1; gold_relation -= 5; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; coalition_dissent += 1 if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour"; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland and concord_formed; warden_ban_timer = 6; warden_coup_progress = coup_progress; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 6; dufour_angry += 8; interior_goal_heartland -= 1
view-if: warden_banned == 0

[? if president == "DuFour": Banning the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> weakens our relationship with President DuFour, as well as the political right and the police. ?][? if president != "DuFour": Banning the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> weakens our relationship with the political right and the police. ?] [? if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour" : It also weakens our coalition due to the influence of DuFour on the right wing of our coalition. ?] In addition, the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> still operates out of public sight.

@unban_sh
view-if: warden_banned = 1 and in_popular_front_heartland == 0 and in_left_front_heartland == 0
on-arrival: warden_banned = 0; warden_strength += 100; coup_progress += 2 if warden_coup_progress >= 6; dufour_angry -= 5

The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> is no longer banned.

@persecute_sh
title: Further persecute the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>.
view-if: warden_banned = 1
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 4 and interior_police_loyalty >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 4 : The judiciary would not allow this. ?] [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.7 : The police are too disloyal to be trusted with this. ?]
on-arrival: warden_strength *= 0.7; warden_militancy -= 0.05; gold_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 3; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; coalition_dissent += 1 if marcher_in_government = 1 and in_grand_coalition = 1 and president = "DuFour"; gold_right += 1; coup_progress -= 1 if coup_progress >= 4; dufour_angry += 5

We have arrested more of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>'s leaders and confiscated their weapons.

[? if coup_progress >= 4: There are reports of a planned coup by the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>. We have cracked down on some of these plans, but the threat still lingers. ?]

@ban_rfb
view-if: communist_coalition < 3 and vanguard_banned = 0 and in_popular_front_heartland == 0 and in_left_front_heartland == 0
on-arrival: collectivist_relation -= 15; vanguard_strength -= 50; vanguard_banned = 1; communist_coalition -= 1; unionist_relation += 5; gold_relation += 5; lvp_relation += 5; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; collectivist_coalition_dissent += 2; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent > 0 and n_vanguard_banned = 0; n_vanguard_banned += 1; dufour_angry -= 8

The ban is enthusiastically carried out by the police, perhaps too enthusiastically. The <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span> take this as one more reason why the <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformists</span> are traitors to the left. However, the <span style="color: #000000;">moderate</span> and <span style="color: #C0A054;">center-right</span> parties approve, as do the police.

@unban_rfb
view-if: vanguard_banned = 1
on-arrival: vanguard_banned = 0; collectivist_relation += 5; vanguard_strength += 50; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.05; interior_police_loyalty -= 0.05; dufour_angry += 8; vanguard_goal_heartland -= 1

The <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivist</span> <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span> is no longer banned.

@persecute_rfb
title: Further persecute the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span>.
view-if: vanguard_banned = 1 and in_popular_front_heartland == 0 and in_left_front_heartland == 0
on-arrival: vanguard_strength *= 0.7; vanguard_militancy -= 0.05; collectivist_relation -= 10; collectivist_coalition_dissent += 1; unionist_relation += 2; gold_relation += 2; lvp_relation += 2; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.1; interior_police_loyalty += 0.1; coalition_dissent -= 1 if coalition_dissent > 0 and n_vanguard_persecuted = 0; n_vanguard_persecuted += 1; dufour_angry -= 5

We have arrested more of the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**Vanguard**</span>'s leaders and confiscated their weapons.
